---
import ProseLayout from '@/layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
import { ROUTES, PUBLIC_EMAIL } from '@/config/site';
import { PUBLISHER } from '@/config/publisher';
const meta = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy',
  description:
    'How Would You Rather Questions handles browser storage, analytics and emails you choose to send us.',
  path: ROUTES.privacy,
};
---

<ProseLayout meta={meta} heading="Privacy Policy" legal>
  <p>
    Last updated:{' '}
    <span class:list={{ placeholder: !PUBLISHER.policyUpdatedAt }}>
      {PUBLISHER.policyUpdatedAt || '[DATE]'}
    </span>
    . Publisher:{' '}
    <span class="placeholder">
      {PUBLISHER.name && PUBLISHER.address
        ? `${PUBLISHER.name} — ${PUBLISHER.address}`
        : 'Would You Rather Questions — legal entity and address to be added'}
    </span>
    . Contact: <a href={`mailto:${PUBLIC_EMAIL}`}>{PUBLIC_EMAIL}</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Game selections.</strong> Selecting an option reveals locally generated display
      results. We do not record individual selections or store an interaction cookie.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting.</strong> Our hosting provider may process technical request data, such as an
      IP address and browser information, to deliver and protect the site.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Emails you send us.</strong> If you use the contact or question suggestion links, your
      email app sends your address and whatever you write to our mailbox. We use that information to
      reply, review suggestions or handle your request. We do not use it for marketing.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Browser storage</strong> remembers your favorites and age confirmation on your device.
      Session storage helps avoid repeating questions during a game session.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How long we keep data</h2>
  <p>
    We keep emails as long as needed to respond, review a suggestion or handle a request. You can
    ask us to delete an email, subject to any applicable legal obligations.
  </p>
  <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Google Analytics 4 and advertising (Google AdSense) load only with your consent via the cookie
    banner, where enabled. Cloudflare Web Analytics, if enabled, is cookieless. You can change your
    choices any time via "Cookie preferences" in the footer. See the{' '}
    <a href={ROUTES.cookies}>Cookie Policy</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>
    Hosting: Cloudflare. Messages sent by email are handled by your email provider and ours.
    Analytics/ads: Google (only when enabled and consented). Data may be processed in the United
    States and other countries.
  </p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live (including the EEA, UK, Switzerland, Canada and Quebec, and US
    states with privacy laws) you may request access, correction or deletion of your data. Email{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${PUBLIC_EMAIL}`}>{PUBLIC_EMAIL}</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    The site is suitable for general audiences; we do not knowingly collect personal information
    from children. Mature categories require an adult confirmation that is stored locally and is not
    identity or age verification.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
